======================================================================
UPSTREAM COMPONENTS
======================================================================

The patch pipeline and patch scripts that originate from the upstream
project (Alexvbp/f1tv-4k-patch and its contributors) stay under that
project's own terms (its README states: "For personal/educational use
only"). The ST14N license above covers only the original work of st14n,
in particular the custom radio extension (extension/src/com/f1tvpatch/radio/)
and the radio/variant changes to the build pipeline.

THE F1 TV APP

The F1 TV app (com.formulaone.production) and everything inside it belongs
to Formula One and its licensors. Patched builds published from this
repository are provided only to let owners of a valid F1 TV subscription
use their own copy on their own devices; they are not licensed by, and
carry no rights from, the owner of the app.
